@using IETT_APP.WebMVC.Extensions
@model IEnumerable<IETT_APP.WebMVC.Areas.Planner.Models.VehicleViewModel>
@inject IETT_APP.WebMVC.Services.Interfaces.IGarageApiService GarageService

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-body table-responsive p-0">
        <table id="vehiclesTable" class="table table-hover table-striped text-nowrap align-middle">
            <thead class="table-dark">
                <tr>
                    <th>Kapı No</th>
                    <th>Plaka</th>
                    <th>Kapasite</th>
                    <th>Garaj</th>
                    <th>Servis Durumu</th>
                    <th>Operatör</th>
                    <th>Model</th>
                    <th>Yıl</th>
                    <th>Kilometre</th>
                    <th>Özellikler</th>
                    <th>Durum</th>
                    <th>Oluşturulma</th>
                    <th>Son Güncelleme</th>
                    <th>İşlemler</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                @if (Model != null && Model.Any())
                {
                    foreach (var item in Model)
                    {
                        var garageName = !string.IsNullOrEmpty(item.GarageName)
                        ? item.GarageName
                        : GarageService.GetByIdAsync(item.GarageId).Result?.GarageName ?? "—";

                        <tr data-id="@item.Id">
                            <td data-field="doorNumber">@item.DoorNumber</td>
                            <td data-field="plateNumber">@item.PlateNumber</td>
                            <td data-field="capacity">@item.Capacity</td>
                            <td class="vehicle-garage-cell"
                                data-field="garage"
                                data-garageid="@item.GarageId"
                                title="@garageName">
                                @garageName
                            </td>
                            <td data-field="serviceStatus" data-value="@((int)item.ServiceStatus)">@item.ServiceStatus.ToDisplayName()</td>
                            <td data-field="operator" data-value="@((int)item.Operator)">@item.Operator.ToDisplayName()</td>
                            <td data-field="model" data-value="@((int)item.Model)">@item.Model.ToDisplayName()</td>
                            <td data-field="year">@item.Year</td>
                            <td data-field="totalKm">@item.TotalKm</td>


                            <!-- Tek hücrede tıklanabilir özellikler popover -->
                            <td>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info features-popover"
                                   data-haswifi="@item.HasWiFi"
                                   data-hasbikerack="@item.HasBikeRack"
                                   data-hasmobilecharging="@item.HasMobileCharging"
                                   data-haspassengerinfosystem="@item.HasPassengerInfoSystem"
                                   data-hascctv="@item.HasCCTV"
                                   data-hasdisabilityaccess="@item.HasDisabilityAccess"
                                   style="cursor:pointer;"
                                   tabindex="0"></i>
                            </td>

                            <td>
                                <button class="toggle-vehicle-active"
                                        data-id="@item.Id"
                                        data-active="@item.IsActive.ToString().ToLower()"
                                        style="min-width: 50px; padding: 0; border: none; background: transparent; cursor: pointer;">
                                    @if (item.IsActive)
                                    {
                                        <span class="badge bg-success rounded-pill" style="font-size:0.8rem; padding:0.35rem 0.75rem;">Aktif</span>
                                    }
                                    else
                                    {
                                        <span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill" style="font-size:0.8rem; padding:0.35rem 0.75rem;">Pasif</span>
                                    }
                                </button>
                            </td>

                            <td>@item.CreatedAt?.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm")</td>
                            <td>@item.UpdatedAt?.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm")</td>

                            <td>
                                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-warning edit-vehicle" data-id="@item.Id">
                                    <i class="fas fa-edit"></i>
                                </button>
                                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-danger delete-vehicle" data-id="@item.Id">
                                    <i class="fas fa-trash-alt"></i>
                                </button>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    }
                }
                else
                {
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="14" class="text-center text-muted">Kayıtlı araç bulunamadı.</td>
                    </tr>
                }
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>
